<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-South Australia 127 for three at close v Tasmania.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-South Australia 127 for three at close v Tasmania.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score in the Sheffield Shield cricket competition on Thursday.</p>
<p>In Hobart (day three): South Australia 387 (Ben Johnson 91, Joe Scuderi 70) and 127 for three (Martin Faull 63 not out); Tasmania 248 (Ricky Ponting 126, Joe Scuderi five for 43).</p>
</text>
